{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/systems\/schedule\/ambiguities()"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ambiguities","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Ambiguity","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Ambiguity","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Systems9AmbiguityV"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ambiguous pairs, ordered by the position of their first system and then","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"their second.","type":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SchedulingSystems"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Such a pair runs in the order it’s written in, which is easy to change by accident. In the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"following schedule, ","type":"text"},{"code":"Gravity","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" writes the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Velocity","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that ","type":"text"},{"code":"Movement","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" reads, but nothing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"says which runs first:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let frame = Schedule {","    Gravity()","    Movement()","}","for ambiguity in frame.ambiguities() {","    print(frame.names[ambiguity.first], frame.names[ambiguity.second])","    \/\/ Prints \"Gravity Movement\"","}","","let ordered = Schedule {","    Gravity()","    Movement().after(Gravity.self)","}","print(ordered.ambiguities().isEmpty)","\/\/ Prints \"true\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Order each pair with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"after(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"before(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", or mark it with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ScheduledSystem\/ambiguous(with:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when either order is right. Systems without an access"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"always run alone, in the order written, and are left out. Call this method in a test to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keep a schedule free of ambiguities."}]},{"name":"Complexity","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"s","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"·("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"s","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" + "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"c"}]},{"type":"text","text":")) for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"s","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" systems and "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"c"}]},{"type":"text","text":" ordered pairs."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Returns every pair of systems whose accesses conflict but that no ordering constraint","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"orders.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Schedule"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Inspecting a Schedule","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Schedule\/systems","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Schedule\/names","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Ambiguity","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Schedule\/writeD